# harness.pdl - the snake book's harness rows, read by harness_menu_op: they show in the editor Harness tab when the snake book is open.
# HARNESS | id | page | kind | label | target | args | writes | confirm | note      (grammar: &.widgits/_shared-lib/ops/harness_menu_op.c header)
HARNESS | snake | * | CASE | snake | snake | - | - | no | the generated realtime game: rules, replay, a hand-edited ledger refused, a stray file fails the audit, deleted projections regenerate
